module.exports = JSON.parse("{\"data\":{\"contentfulAbout\":{\"aboutMe\":{\"childMarkdownRemark\":{\"rawMarkdownBody\":\"Hello, my name is Gabriela Shirley! \\n\\nI am a rising senior majoring in Computer Science with a minor in Design at the [University of California, San Diego](https://ucsd.edu/), will be graduating in June 2021! Born and raised in Jakarta, Indonesia since January 13, 1999. (◔ᴥ◔)\\n\\nI am driven to expand my horizons in different types of fields and hope to use my accumulated knowledge to make an impact on my community and even the world. Although I am focusing on Computer Science, specifically Web/Software Engineer, I also plan on studying design and human cognition in order to combine both my technical and personal skills and create new applications that will ultimately help others.\\n\\nI am passionate about being a woman agent of change with my work in the tech field and willing to get hands-on with any websites, applications, or anything in between.\\n\\nPlease feel free to reach me out for any inquiries! 🤗\\n\\n*I am currently looking for Summer 2020 internship and full-time job opportunities after my June 2021 graduation. *\"}},\"profile\":{\"title\":\"Gabriela Shirley\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"//images.ctfassets.net/q3dg0wjmiemr/4UnctT88v7LbGitCEnIjrD/34fb341d0b291833a8b9e31bb801f265/IMG_7386.JPG?w=450&fl=progressive&q=100\"}}}}}");

